    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27756" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διωκ-τέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, verb. Adj. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διώκω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be pursued,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.58
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				221
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of objects,
				<i>to be pursued,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				167d
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διωκτέον</span>”
				<i>one must pursue,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					507d
				</span></i>
			, al.: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διωκτέα ἐφαίνετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>An.</u>
					3.21.6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
